WEBVTT

00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:14,480
I just heard about rejuvenation. Some say it is great for healing.

00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:19,200
Another site said to avoid it. If you have leaky gutter Candida,

00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,000
overgrowth, if you heard of this, you think it's good.

00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,960
Or gut healing is important to use gluten-free grain or is gluten-negligible in

00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,080
the finished product. So rejuvenation is something you make.

00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:37,680
It's a fermented grain is what it is. You ferment a grain.

00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:42,880
Now, you could use wheat berries, you could use oat berries, you could use

00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:49,360
quinoa. If you're going to do it, I think it's important to use a gluten-free grain

00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:55,680
like quinoa. And are there benefits to fermented

00:00:55,680 --> 00:01:00,400
products? Yes, there's great benefits to fermented products.

00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,280
If you have yeast issues, should you use fermented products?

00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,800
No, you shouldn't. So yes, you should not do it with Candida.

00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:10,320
I wouldn't say that you can't do it with leaky gut.

00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:17,040
But I wouldn't do it with, if you have a Candida, overgrowth or you think you do.

00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,600
And some people do well with fermented products like that.

00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:25,200
And some people, it makes things worse. So you just, you know,

00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:29,040
it could give you a clue of what's going on. This person might not have no idea

00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,680
that they have Candida because they have no, you know,

00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:36,320
vaginal Candida, they don't even think that they have intestinal Candida.

00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:39,280
They've never even had any symptoms like that. And then they do a,

00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:44,720
it's even drinking a kombucha or something like that because it's on the order of a kombucha.

00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:49,120
So they drink a kombucha and it really upsets their stomach. Well, that's a hint that you

00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:54,480
could have some yeast overgrowth that you don't even, you didn't even know.

00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:58,320
So Candida is more common than you think.

00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:04,000
And the person could have no other external symptoms of Candida.

00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,360
You know, they don't have a white tongue or they don't have any vaginal yeast growth or anything

00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:16,320
like that, but they have a intestinal Candida. But I would definitely go with a gluten-free grade.

00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:21,440
Is the gluten in the finished product? I would say yes, it is still.

00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:25,920
So I would go with a gluten-free grade if you're going to try it.

